    "title": "Suspects arrested after dramatic woods chase with assault rifle in possession - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Scott Solomon ,\n3 hours ago Austin, Ark. (KATV) — Two suspects have been arrested after fleeing into the woods with an AR-15 after a vehicle accident near Highway 367 and Highway 305 in Austin. Wednesday, November 5, The Lonoke County Sheriff's Office and Cabot PD's K9 teams tracked and arrested both suspects following an extensive search. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
